{"retcode":0,"message":"OK","data":{"page":{"id":"509937","name":"苍雷奔涌","desc":"苍雷奔涌卡牌","icon_url":"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2026/09/23/258999284/54ef44bad887d6264d05e2f51838752d_8483313755194943352.png","header_img_url":"","modules":[{"name":"基础信息","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"card_base_info","layout":"","data":"{\"moduleName\":\"基础信息\",\"layout_\":\"left\",\"name\":\"苍雷奔涌\",\"common_img\":\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2026/09/23/258999284/54ef44bad887d6264d05e2f51838752d_5577211759331105925.png\",\"gold_img\":\"\",\"life\":2,\"life_bg\":5,\"energy\":0,\"energy_bg\":0,\"attr\":[{\"key\":\"类型：\",\"value\":[\"装备牌\"]},{\"key\":\"标签：\",\"value\":[\"天赋\"]},{\"key\":\"获取：\",\"value\":[\"卡牌商店购买获取\"]},{\"key\":\"花费：\",\"value\":[\"2\"]}],\"baseInfoSwitchDisabled\":false}","style":""}],"id":"1","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"效果描述","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"collapse_panel","layout":"","data":"{\"rich_text\":\"\u003chtml\u003e\u003chead\u003e\u003c/head\u003e\u003cbody\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"\u003e\u003cu\u003e战斗行动\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\\\"详情\\\" data-name=\\\"\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026#34;color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\u0026#34;\u0026gt;战斗行动：\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026#34;color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\u0026#34;\u0026gt;我方执行了一次战斗行动后，会轮到对方行动。\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026#34;color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\u0026#34;\u0026gt;打出具有此规则的手牌是一个战斗行动，而非快速行动。\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\\\" class=\\\"wiki-note-text\\\"\u003e\u003csup class=\\\"wiki-sup\\\"\u003e[详情]\u003c/sup\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"\u003e：我方出战角色为\u003c/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"\u003e雷泽\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"\u003e时，装备此牌。\u003cbr/\u003e我方\u003c/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"\u003e雷泽\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"\u003e如果未附属\u003c/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"\u003e\u003cu\u003e雷狼\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\\\"详情\\\" data-name=\\\"\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026#34;color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\u0026#34;\u0026gt;雷狼：\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026#34;color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\u0026#34;\u0026gt;状态\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026#34;color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\u0026#34;\u0026gt;所附属角色使用普通攻击或元素战技后：\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026#34;color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\u0026#34;\u0026gt;造成2点\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026#34;color: rgb(114, 46, 209)\u0026#34;\u0026gt;雷元素伤害\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026#34;color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\u0026#34;\u0026gt;。\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026#34;color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\u0026#34;\u0026gt;持续回合：2\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\\\" class=\\\"wiki-note-text\\\"\u003e\u003csup class=\\\"wiki-sup\\\"\u003e[详情]\u003c/sup\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"\u003e，则自身附属持续回合为1的\u003c/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"\u003e\u003cu\u003e雷狼\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\\\"详情\\\" data-name=\\\"\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026#34;color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\u0026#34;\u0026gt;雷狼：\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026#34;color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\u0026#34;\u0026gt;状态\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026#34;color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\u0026#34;\u0026gt;所附属角色使用普通攻击或元素战技后：\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026#34;color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\u0026#34;\u0026gt;造成2点\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026#34;color: rgb(114, 46, 209)\u0026#34;\u0026gt;雷元素伤害\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026#34;color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\u0026#34;\u0026gt;。\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026#34;color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\u0026#34;\u0026gt;持续回合：2\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\\\" class=\\\"wiki-note-text\\\"\u003e\u003csup class=\\\"wiki-sup\\\"\u003e[详情]\u003c/sup\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"\u003e。\u003cbr/\u003e装备有此牌的雷泽附属\u003c/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"\u003e\u003cu\u003e雷狼\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\\\"详情\\\" data-name=\\\"\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026#34;color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\u0026#34;\u0026gt;雷狼：\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026#34;color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\u0026#34;\u0026gt;状态\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026#34;color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\u0026#34;\u0026gt;所附属角色使用普通攻击或元素战技后：\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026#34;color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\u0026#34;\u0026gt;造成2点\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026#34;color: rgb(114, 46, 209)\u0026#34;\u0026gt;雷元素伤害\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026#34;color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\u0026#34;\u0026gt;。\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026#34;color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\u0026#34;\u0026gt;持续回合：2\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\\\" class=\\\"wiki-note-text\\\"\u003e\u003csup class=\\\"wiki-sup\\\"\u003e[详情]\u003c/sup\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"\u003e期间，我方\u003c/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"\u003e\u003cu\u003e雷狼\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\\\"详情\\\" data-name=\\\"\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026#34;color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\u0026#34;\u0026gt;雷狼：\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026#34;color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\u0026#34;\u0026gt;状态\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026#34;color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\u0026#34;\u0026gt;所附属角色使用普通攻击或元素战技后：\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026#34;color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\u0026#34;\u0026gt;造成2点\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026#34;color: rgb(114, 46, 209)\u0026#34;\u0026gt;雷元素伤害\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026#34;color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\u0026#34;\u0026gt;。\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026#34;color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\u0026#34;\u0026gt;持续回合：2\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\\\" class=\\\"wiki-note-text\\\"\u003e\u003csup class=\\\"wiki-sup\\\"\u003e[详情]\u003c/sup\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"\u003e造成的伤害+1。\u003cbr/\u003e（牌组中包含雷泽，才能加入牌组）\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/body\u003e\u003c/html\u003e\",\"switch\":true,\"is_show_switch\":true,\"without_border\":false}\n","style":""}],"id":"2","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":true,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"卡牌故事","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"collapse_panel","layout":"","data":"{\"rich_text\":\"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e雷泽·苍雷奔涌\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e「在漫长的岁月里，长生的魔女会失去很多很多东西。这句话不是骗人的，因为世上从来没有什么东西，是在失去后寻找就能找到的。在遥远的世界里，即便是同样被狼群抚养长大的孩子亦会兄弟阋墙、彼此反目，但至少在这个世界里，狼的孩子能找到家的温暖吧。」\u003c/p\u003e\",\"switch\":true,\"is_show_switch\":true,\"without_border\":false}\n","style":""}],"id":"3","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":true,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"collapse_panel","layout":"","data":"{\"rich_text\":\"\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"switch\":false,\"is_show_switch\":false,\"without_border\":true}\n","style":""}],"id":"6632","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":true,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"","is_poped":false,"components":[{"compo